silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_04_sections_01_concrete_anchor_4#headobscoconestagen silm:hasLongDescription "The HeadObsCoconeStageN is the stage-n cocone leg from HeadObs77 into Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'LegCocone(l)^{(n)}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
